Package: climatePlaylists
Title: Beats per Million - Dance While You Can
Version: 5.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Martin", "Wegmann", role = "aut",
	   comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5294-2978")),
    person("Lena", "Thoele", role = c("aut", "cre"),
	   comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5405-3613"),
           email = "lena.thoele@gmail.com"))
Description: Converts atmospheric CO2 concentrations through geological time into
    beats-per-minute values to sonify climate change, with an interactive Shiny
    app and a playlist-template generator. Data span modern Mauna Loa
    measurements, the CMIP7 historical CO2 record (1850 on), the 800 kyr Antarctic ice-core composite, and Cenozoic marine
    proxies.
URL: https://beatspermillion.shinyapps.io/dance/,
    https://github.com/l-m-thole/beats-per-million
